column td_runtime_writer_checkpoint_v1.committed_at_micros: writer stamps the commit with the wall clock
column td_runtime_writer_idempotency_v2.committed_at_micros: writer stamps the commit with the wall clock
column remote_spool_frames.nonce: each spooled frame is sealed under a fresh random nonce
column remote_spool_frames.ciphertext: ciphertext depends on the random nonce
json key committed_at: commit receipts carry the writer's wall-clock commit time
path <store temp dir>: replaced with $STORE in errors and text values
